---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Writing | Imam Hossain Roni" sideBarActiveItemID="blog" wide>
  <article class="wrap pt-12 md:pt-20">
    <header class="max-w-5xl">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-6" data-reveal>Writing · A short note</p>
      <h1 class="display text-[clamp(3rem,8.5vw,7.5rem)]" data-reveal style="--d:1">
        Why I stopped writing <em>tech blogs</em>
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-14 md:mt-20 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12">
      <aside class="md:col-span-3 eyebrow leading-loose" data-reveal style="--d:2">
        <p>By Imam Hossain Roni</p>
        <p>1 min read</p>
      </aside>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-7 text-lg md:text-xl leading-[1.75] grid gap-6 text-pretty [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:float-left [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:font-serif [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:text-[4.6em] [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:leading-[0.8] [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:mr-3 [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:mt-1 [&>p:first-child]:first-letter:text-accent"
        data-reveal
        style="--d:3"
      >
        <p>In the era of LLMs, I don't think writing tech blogs is as necessary as it once was.</p>
        <p class="text-muted">
          There was a time when I'd spend my evenings turning something I had just figured out into a post, hoping it
          would save someone else a few hours of frustration. Today, anyone can ask an LLM and get a clear, patient
          explanation in seconds, shaped around exactly where they are stuck.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted">So I stopped writing tutorials.</p>
        <blockquote class="display text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.08] border-l-2 border-accent pl-6 my-4">
          When I write now, I write what I feel: the thoughts that don't fit into a prompt.
        </blockquote>
        <p class="text-muted">
          If you're here to learn something technical, LLMs are good enough. Honestly, they're a wonderful teacher.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted">My earlier writing, and some of my more abstract thoughts, are kept as an archive.</p>

        <a
          href="https://imamhossainroni.hashnode.dev/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="group mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-6 border-y border-line py-7"
        >
          <span>
            <span class="eyebrow block mb-2">Archive</span>
            <span class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">RIP Abstract Thoughts</span>
          </span>
          <span
            class="grid h-12 w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-[--accent-ink] group-hover:rotate-45"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
